        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX LD320B, Square Double Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Square Double Cylinder Deadbolt is made from wrought stainless steel and is available in satin stainless steel, polished stainless steel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. The Stainless Steel 2-3/8 Square Deadbolt will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. It is easy to install and accommodates doors that are 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. The INOX LD Series Deadbolt  is a double cylinder deadbolt, meaning it is locked and unlocked by a key from both sides. Double cylinder deadbolts are most often used on doors that have glass windows.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Square Wrought Stainless Steel Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C, 5-pin</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Concealed M5 thru-bolt installation.</li>\r\n<li>For residential or light-duty commercial applications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the INOX LD320B 2-3/8\" Square Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-3/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Width: 23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt\" 1\" throw</i>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-LD320B-specifications.pdf?v=1704262430\"><b>INOX LD320B Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-Finish-3.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"600\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Inox Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
